kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "package-tui-autocomplete"
purpose: "自动补全：CancellationToken 取消、可选 fd 模糊搜、DebouncedAutocomplete。"
valid_scope[2]: src/,tests/
requirements[3]{req_id,title,statement}:
  ac01,"async-cancellable-autocomplete","The autocomplete system MUST support asynchronous suggestion fetching with CancellationToken-based cancellation so that in-flight file-system queries can be aborted when the user types new input, mirroring pi's AbortSignal pattern. The CombinedAutocompleteProvider MUST expose an async method accepting CancellationToken for its fuzzy file search path."
  ac02,"walk-directory-with-fd","The autocomplete system MUST support recursive fuzzy filesystem search by spawning the fd(1) command-line tool as a subprocess with arguments matching pi's walkDirectoryWithFd: --base-directory, --max-results, --type f, --type d, --follow, --hidden, and --full-path when the query contains a path separator. fdPath MUST be optional (None = no fd, fall back to read_dir stub). On CancellationToken cancellation the subprocess MUST receive SIGKILL."
  ac03,"debounced-autocomplete","A DebouncedAutocomplete<P> wrapper MUST debounce successive get_suggestions calls by the configured delay (default 250ms, aligning with pi's setTimeout). When a new call arrives within the window the previous CancellationToken MUST be cancelled and only the latest query proceeds. The debounce MUST be testable via #[tokio::test(start_paused)] for deterministic window behavior."
scenarios[7]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  ac01,"async-cancellation",a CombinedAutocompleteProvider with fd_path set is in the middle of an fd subprocess query,its CancellationToken is cancelled,the subprocess gets SIGKILL and get_suggestions_async returns immediately with empty results
  ac01,"async-fuzzy-with-fd",a CombinedAutocompleteProvider has fd_path pointing to a valid fd binary,get_suggestions_async is called with an @ prefix query,fd subprocess runs and results match the same query run via shell fd commands
  ac02,"fd-recursive-search-finds-nested-files",a tempdir contains nested directories with files,walk_directory_with_fd is called with base_dir pointing to the tempdir and a query matching deep files,results include the nested file paths with trailing slashes on directories
  ac02,"fd-path-none-fallback",fdPath is None,get_fuzzy_file_suggestions is called,"the function falls back to the existing non-recursive read_dir and returns results"
  ac03,"debounce-drops-intermediate-calls",a DebouncedAutocomplete is configured with 250ms delay,three get_suggestions calls arrive at 0ms/50ms/100ms and only the last one proceeds,the first two CancellationTokens are cancelled and only the 100ms call's results are returned after the 350ms point
  ac03,"debounce-cancellation-stops-in-flight",a debounced query has started its fd subprocess,a new call cancels the previous token,the old subprocess receives SIGKILL and the new query runs to completion
  ac03,"debounce-in-test","#[tokio::test(start_paused)] is active and DebouncedAutocomplete delay is 250ms",a get_suggestions call arrives at time 0ms,"tokio::time::advance(250ms).await causes the query to fire without waiting real wall-clock time"
